      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir40">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e98">Caput 40</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e102">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_2@1-1">Cogitationes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir40-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir40-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e113">Enumerat mala quae homo pro peccatis sustinet.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e117">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e119">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e121">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e123" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_6@1-1">Modicum.</quote>
            Quia caro mortua et insensibilis ad tempus requiescere videtur, anima jam sentit dolorem, et post resurrectionem cum corpore suo in poenis vivet aeternis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e128">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e130">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e132">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e134" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_7@1-2">Conturbatus est.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir40-Rd1e137"><name xml:id="gom-sir40-Nd1e138" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e141"><seg type="qs">Ideo mali cruciabuntur in poena</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nobilium scilicet <pb ed="#P" n="1222C"/> et ignobilium.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e152">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e154">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e156">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e158" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_10@7-12">Et propter illos factus est cataclysmus.</quote>
            Peccanti homini multiplex poena deputata est, ut correctus poeniteat, et deinceps caveat; sed quia negligit, et in poenis proficit, inducit Deus diluvium orbi, ut hominem deleret quem creavit. Ad comparationem vero futurae poenae nihil est quod homo patitur in praesenti.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e164">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e166">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e168">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e170" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_11@9-11">Et aquae omnes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir40-Rd1e173"><name xml:id="gom-sir40-Nd1e174" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e177">Opera scilicet peccatorum supernae mercedis fructum non acquirunt, sed poenarum interitum.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e181">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e183">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e185">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e187" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_13@1-2">Substantiae injustorum.</quote>
            Inchoant germinare, sed fluctuant in tentatione, et subito arescunt ad primum persecutionis aestum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e194">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_15@1-4">Nepotes impiorum non multi.</quote>
            Saepe <pb ed="#P" n="1222D"/> videmus progeniem impiorum cito deficere, maxime cum filii imitantur iniquitatem patrum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e205">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e207">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e209">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e211" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_18@1-3">Vita sibi sufficientis.</quote>
            Dulcis est somnus operanti, sive parum, sive multum comedat.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e215">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e217" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_18@9-10">Invenies thesaurum.</quote>
            Vere enim Christianum se esse probat, qui Christi mandata credit et facit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e222">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e224">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e226">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e228" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_20@1-5">Vinum et musica laetificant cor.</quote>
            Haec naturaliter mulcent et exhilarant animam, sed dilectio sapientiae et lingua suaviter docens multo plus confortat intellectum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e233">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e235">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e237">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e239" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_22@1-5">Gratiam et speciem desiderabit oculus.</quote>
            Ornatum scilicet templi et culturae diversitatem, quae prior populus sub lege habuit, praedicatio Evangelii in orbe seminata, bonorum operum virore excellit
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e245">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e247">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e249">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1223A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e253" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_26@1-3">Facultates et virtutes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir40-Rd1e256"><name xml:id="gom-sir40-Nd1e257" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e260"><seg type="qs">Divitiae datae in Domino</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et haec et omnes facultates mundi.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e269">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e271">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e273">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e275" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_30@1-2">Vir respiciens.</quote>
            Stultum est enim otiari, et de alieno labore mercedem quaerere. Percipiet enim unusquisque secundum opera sua.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir40-Dd1e280">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir40-Hd1e282">Versus 32</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir40-d1e284">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir40-Qd1e286" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir40_32@1-5">In ore imprudentis conculcabitur inopia,</quote>
            etc. Cui placet otiose torpere, nec proximis docendo prodesse, tandem doloribus inferni et sera poenitentia aestuabit.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
